body:
Hi there, thanks for reaching out. 
You should be able to achieve this with initialUiState.
Roughly, for the price attribute:
 
```js
const search = instantsearch({
  indexName: 'my_index',
  initialUiState: {
    my_index: {
      range: {
        price: '200:400',
      },
    },
  },
});
```

Here is an example: https://codesandbox.io/s/affectionate-colden-cj7k9?file=/src/app.js:42-292
I hope it helps!
